Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for Alcaz Prison, a Forever dungeon on Alcaz Island in Dustwallow Marsh \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 48-51 Alcaz Prison]
[NX 48-51 Maraudon]

The prison quests open at level 48. Both factions get the same two quests inside from Mason Connery; save The Questioner for last or his quest never shows.

-- Left out: 96379 State Secrets (the Steamwheedle version at Rix Xizzix, Booty Bay): a third way to hand in the Document Box; the faction versions are in the optional blocks.
-- Left out: 8970 I See Alcaz Island In Your Future... (level 60 Darkmoon Faire quest on the island, not a prison quest).

-- Horde pickups: Orgrimmar, Brackenwall Village, Alcaz Island.
[A Horde] In Orgrimmar, at Doras, get the Orgrimmar flight path [P Orgrimmar] [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar]
[A Horde] In Grommash Hold, Eitrigg gives [QA95283 The Missing Kor'kron] [G34.3,39.4 Orgrimmar] \\ Needs level 48.
[A Horde] Fly to Brackenwall Village if you know the flight path [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar] \\ No flight tag: this guide does not teach it. Without it, walk the next steps.
[A Horde] Without the flight: out of the main gate to the zeppelin road [G45.5,12.0 Durotar] [OC]
[A Horde] Without the flight: south on the Durotar road and over the Southfury bridge [G41.0,25.0 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar][G61.8,20.0 The Barrens] [OC]
[A Horde] Without the flight: west and south to the Crossroads, then the road to Ratchet [G51.0,20.0 The Barrens][G52.0,30.0 The Barrens][G59.0,34.0 The Barrens] [OC]
[A Horde] Without the flight: south on the east road into Dustwallow Marsh [G62.7,39.7 The Barrens][G62.9,48.0 The Barrens][G62.8,53.6 The Barrens][G53.5,10.7 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC]
[A Horde] Without the flight: south-west to Brackenwall Village [G35.6,31.8 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC]
[A Horde] At Shardi, get the Brackenwall Village flight path [P Brackenwall Village] [G35.6,31.8 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Horde] Nazeer Bloodpike takes [QT95283 The Missing Kor'kron] and gives [QA95284 The Elite of the Elite] [G35.2,30.7 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Horde] East on the north road to the shore [G57.2,20.8 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC]
[A Horde] East to the tip of the point [G64.0,19.0 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC]
[A Horde] Swim east across the strait to the Alcaz Island dock [G70.3,18.9 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC] \\ No source names a boat to the island (DJ entrance: "from the dock take the path up the hill"; no DJ routeGuide; no Wowhead comment on 95284/95285); a boat is unverified, so swim. Strashaz naga (elite 59-61) swim near the island: keep north of them.
[A Horde] On the dock, Sergeant Ulka takes [QT95284 The Elite of the Elite] and gives [QA95285 Right Place, Wrong Time] [G70.3,18.9 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Horde] Talk to Ulka [QC95285 Right Place, Wrong Time], turn it in [QT95285 Right Place, Wrong Time] and accept [QA95309 No Orc Left Behind] [QA96334 Blood Red Bandanas] [QA96332 A Little Payback] [G70.3,18.9 Dustwallow Marsh]

-- Alliance pickups: Stormwind, Menethil Harbor, the optional Dalaran trip, Theramore.
[A Alliance] In Stormwind, at Dungar Longdrink, get the Stormwind flight path [P Stormwind] [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] In Old Town, at SI:7, Master Mathias Shaw gives [QA95194 Our Man in Theramore] [G78.3,70.7 Stormwind City] \\ Needs level 48.
[A Alliance] Fly to Menethil Harbor if you know the flight path [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City] \\ No flight tag: this guide does not teach it. Without it, take the boats in the next steps.
[A Alliance] Without the flight: walk west to the harbor pier [G66.8,63.8 Stormwind City][G56.2,64.6 Stormwind City][G44.6,53.5 Stormwind City][G36.5,45.2 Stormwind City][G29.6,54.1 Stormwind City][G21.8,56.9 Stormwind City] [OC]
[A Alliance] Without the flight: take the boat to Auberdine [G21.8,56.9 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Without the flight: walk to the south pier [G30.5,40.9 Darkshore][G32.3,44.1 Darkshore] and take the boat to Menethil Harbor [G32.3,44.1 Darkshore]
[A Alliance] At Shellei Brondir, get the Menethil Harbor flight path [P Menethil Harbor] [G9.5,59.7 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Optional, level 46 and up: the Dalaran trip for The Dragon's Journal. Archmage Lan'dalock gives it and takes it back, so it costs two visits; skip this block and its turn-in block and you lose nothing else.
[A Alliance] Optional: walk to the pier [G4.5,56.7 Wetlands] and take the boat to Southshore [G4.5,56.7 Wetlands] \\ It may call at Auberdine first; stay on board.
[A Alliance] Optional: walk up into Southshore [G50.7,70.4 Hillsbrad Foothills][G50.0,58.0 Hillsbrad Foothills] [OC] \\ Bob McNaught (level 40), Crimeon (28) and Southshore Defenders (55) in and by Southshore may attack.
[A Alliance] Optional: at Darla Harris, get the Southshore flight path [P Southshore] [G49.4,52.1 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Alliance] Optional: north-west across the hills toward Alterac [G40.9,33.7 Hillsbrad Foothills][G32.9,15.0 Hillsbrad Foothills] [OC] \\ Yetis (level 30-32) sit in the caves to the west.
[A Alliance] Optional: up to Dalaran by the south gate [G22.5,82.0 Alterac Mountains][G18.2,76.9 Alterac Mountains] [OC] \\ An elite Arcane Sentry (level 55) may stand by the road.
[A Alliance] Optional: Archmage Lan'dalock, outside the Violet Hold, gives [QA96772 The Dragon's Journal] [G15.3,73.9 Alterac Mountains] \\ QuestieDB flags him and Archmage Timear (elite 55) beside him as hostile; Wowhead shows him friendly to Alliance (reactalliance 1) and a comment says "picked up in dalaran by violet hold": https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=96772
[A Alliance] Optional: back down to Southshore [G18.2,76.9 Alterac Mountains][G22.5,82.0 Alterac Mountains][G32.9,15.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G40.9,33.7 Hillsbrad Foothills][G49.4,52.1 Hillsbrad Foothills] [OC]
[A Alliance] Optional: fly back to Menethil Harbor [F Menethil Harbor] [G49.4,52.1 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Alliance] Walk to the Theramore pier [G4.7,63.8 Wetlands] and take the boat to Theramore [G4.7,63.8 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Walk up into Theramore; at Baldruc, get the Theramore flight path [P Theramore] [G67.5,51.2 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Alliance] In the inn, Sully McCleary takes [QT95194 Our Man in Theramore] and gives [QA95196 Watch Yer Back] [G66.3,45.1 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Alliance] Out over the bridge west of Theramore: Sully waits there. Turn in [QT95196 Watch Yer Back] and accept [QA95198 The Return of the King?] [G63.5,42.3 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Alliance] Back to the mage tower: use the SI:7 Disguise Kit, talk to the guard beside Archmage Tervosh and relieve him, then wait out the talk [QC95198 The Return of the King?] [G66.4,49.3 Dustwallow Marsh] \\ Keep away from Jaina: she sees through the disguise. If you stay stuck after the quest completes, use the leave-vehicle button.
[A Alliance] Back to Sully over the bridge: turn in [QT95198 The Return of the King?] and accept [QA95262 The Secret Prison] [QA96381 A Bit of Wet Work] [G63.5,42.3 Dustwallow Marsh]
[A Alliance] North on the road [G63.5,38.0 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.3,27.0 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC]
[A Alliance] North-east to the tip of the point [G64.0,19.0 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC]
[A Alliance] Swim east across the strait to the Alcaz Island dock [G70.3,18.9 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC] \\ Sergeant Ulka (Horde, level 55) stands on the dock: do not pull him. No source names a boat to the island (DJ entrance text, no DJ routeGuide, no Wowhead comment); a boat is unverified, so swim. Strashaz naga (elite 59-61) swim near the island: keep north of them.

[A Horde] Up the path from the dock [G72.6,18.2 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC] \\ Elite Strashaz naga (59-61) patrol the shore below the prison; stay on the path.
[A Alliance] Up the path from the dock, away from Ulka [G72.6,18.2 Dustwallow Marsh] [OC] \\ Elite Strashaz naga (59-61) patrol the shore below the prison; stay on the path.
The entrance is in the cellar of the prison building at the north end of the island [G75.3,14.1 Dustwallow Marsh]

Inside Alcaz Prison:
[A Horde] Find Commander Folkar [QC95309 No Orc Left Behind], turn it in [QT95309 No Orc Left Behind] and accept [QA95454 The Honor of the Kor'kron]
[A Horde] Collect 8 Blood Red Bandanas from the Defias guards [QC96334 Blood Red Bandanas] \\ Low drop rate; players needed several runs.
[A Alliance] Explore the prison [QC95262 The Secret Prison]
Free Mason Connery and accept [QA96335 The Man in the Iron Chains] \\ Do not kill The Questioner before this, or the quest never appears.
[A Horde] Kill 15 Strashaz Soldiers, 8 Strashaz Enchantresses and Tidemistress Ca'zass, and take her head [QC96332 A Little Payback]
[A Alliance] Kill 15 Strashaz Soldiers, 8 Strashaz Enchantresses and Tidemistress Ca'zass, and take her head [QC96381 A Bit of Wet Work]
[A Alliance] Kill Blazeroar (Zarla Ober) and loot Zarla's Journal [QC96772 The Dragon's Journal] \\ Only if you took it in Dalaran.
Kill The Questioner last and loot the Ornate Shackle Key [QC96335 The Man in the Iron Chains] \\ Low drop rate.
Mason Connery takes [QT96335 The Man in the Iron Chains] and gives [QA96337 More Valuable Than Gold] \\ One player reports it could not be turned in after the group had; turn it in together.
[A Horde] After the last boss a Perfumed Note lies on the ground: find Varian and read it [QC95454 The Honor of the Kor'kron] [QT95454 The Honor of the Kor'kron] and accept [QA96369 Bad News for Folkar]
[A Horde] Folkar takes [QT96369 Bad News for Folkar] and gives [QA95483 Thrall Needs to Know]
[A Alliance] Learn what became of Varian (the note on the ground after the last boss) to finish [QT95262 The Secret Prison], then accept [QA95263 Somber News] \\ QuestieDB has no start for 95263; Wowhead (https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=95263) lists only the end at Sully; the start at the note is judgement from the 95262 text.

