[A Horde] Optional: take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar [G31.5,29.1 Stranglethorn Vale] and walk in [G45.5,12.0 Durotar][G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar] [OC]
[A Horde] Optional: Nazgrel, in the Valley of Wisdom, takes [QT96376 State Secrets] [G32.3,35.8 Orgrimmar]

